nce we already argued for B earlier, we can reaffirm B, perhaps adding something about needing to discuss C before final. But we must give a vote. Let's reaffirm B, maybe note that we still think B is best, but we need to discuss C. Provide evidence: B very conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, excellent computer skills, but has weak memory for numbers, pretentious, wrong tone. Compare to A's communication difficulty and egocentric, D's hot temper. So we keep B. Provide public message and metadata with vote Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
